~ furnace
do freezePlayer()
Queen: This machine, it is their fuel storage for their defense.
Queen: Without it they are defenseless
Queen: Shall we take a peek at much much remains?
- Look
	=> look
- Walk Away
	Queen: I can wait.
do unfreezePlayer()
=> END

~ look
do playAnimation("fade", cutscene_player, false)
do wait(1)
Queen: I thought we had so much more time..
Queen: It seems you have only 7 or so days to sway me, it would be in your interest you try.
Queen: My curiosities are satisfied, you can explore but do bring us home soon.
Queen: You humans tire so quickly.
do playAnimation("fade", cutscene_player, true)
do unfreezePlayer()
=> END